{"agent_id":"pp3g-lqzT-research-read-only-do-not-modify-files-produce-a-full","agent_seq":4,"timestamp":"2026-08-18T06:01:23.676067768Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"de06e91e-ec85-4cb8-8720-2a04f8d8c830","comment_uuid":"38fb5f9d-af6b-4362-8e69-205c6114d77a","author":"pp3g-lqzT-research-read-only-do-not-modify-files-produce-a-full","content":"Plan: Full inventory of agent-orchestration-playbook.md — every rule, mandate, procedure, and anti-pattern classified by hookability (OpenCode plugin, Claude Code PreToolUse/PostToolUse, crosslink CLI hookpoint, shell wrapper, or NOT hookable). Will produce a table for every section covering §1-§13 plus the Quick Reference. Include identification of rules already hook-enforced today.","created_at":"2026-08-18T06:01:23.665585175Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:9TRb5HVa3C7bq7HTLrDxAztj6bweiD12ftsC2zrybsE","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg2Pt3VHMy5R3w/qmiRgtx/SVHu9bNoz1TPtezCky1qzMAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABA+jAUZ72Z/WSFPvQdwJQiZYdel4S1DLyNwb8Y8El7V4eNbuduo8JR04JQeQSwH8BPSPlwhZFSIjkRI36ORTCVAQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:9TRb5HVa3C7bq7HTLrDxAztj6bweiD12ftsC2zrybsE","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg2Pt3VHMy5R3w/qmiRgtx/SVHu9bNoz1TPtezCky1qzMAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQDfI5my487klkn7mNn2/fzRQySKZZigMbYuBN8VAUaixv3+2hl//pLoK+bJO89wZopI3QmUVJwAqIZ8TzjQZ+A0="}
